#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:1
msgid "The texture brush settings option in Krita."
msgstr "L'opció dels ajustaments del pinzell de textura al Krita."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:12
#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:17
#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:22
msgid "Texture"
msgstr "Textura"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:12
msgid "Patterns"
msgstr "Patrons"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:19
msgid ""
"This allows you to have textured strokes. This parameter always shows up as "
"two parameters:"
msgstr ""
"Permetrà tenir traços amb textura. Aquest paràmetre sempre es mostra com a "
"dos paràmetres:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:24
#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:56
msgid "Pattern"
msgstr "Patró"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:25
msgid "Which pattern you'll be using."
msgstr "Quin patró utilitzareu."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:27
msgid "The size of the pattern. 1.0 is 100%."
msgstr "La mida del patró. L'1,0 és el 100%."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:28
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "Escala"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:31
msgid "How much a brush is offset, random offset sets a new per stroke."
msgstr ""
"Quant es desplaça un pinzell, el desplaçament aleatori establirà un de nou "
"per traç."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:32
msgid "Horizontal Offset & Vertical Offset"
msgstr "Desplaçament horitzontal i Desplaçament vertical"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:35
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Multiply"
msgid "Multiply Alpha"
msgstr "Multiplica"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:36
msgid ""
"Uses alpha multiplication to determine the effect of the texture. Has a soft "
"feel."
msgstr ""
"Utilitza la multiplicació alfa per a determinar l'efecte de la textura. Té "
"una sensació suau."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:38
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Subtract"
msgid "Subtract Alpha"
msgstr "Sostreu"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:38
msgid ""
"Uses subtraction to determine the effect of the texture. Has a harsher, more "
"texture feel."
msgstr ""
"Utilitza la resta per a determinar l'efecte de la textura. Té una sensació "
"més aspra, amb més textura."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:40
msgid "Lightness and Gradient Map options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:43
msgid "Lightness Map"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:44
msgid ""
"Applies lightness values of the texture to the paint.  Can be used to "
"simulate paper/canvas, or for painting a texture, like reptile skin or tree "
"bark."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:46
msgid "Gradient Map"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:46
msgid ""
"Maps gray/lightness values of the texture to the currently selected "
"gradient.   Useful for painting textures with multiple colors, like reptile "
"skin, tree bark, stars, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:49
msgid "Texturing mode"
msgstr "Mode de textura"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:52
msgid ""
"Cutoff policy will determine what range and where the strength will affect "
"the textured outcome."
msgstr ""
"La política de retall determinarà quin interval i on afectarà la intensitat "
"al resultat amb textura."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:54
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Desactivat"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:55
msgid "Doesn't cut off. Full range will be used."
msgstr "No es retallarà i s'utilitzarà tot l'interval."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:57
msgid "Cuts the pattern off."
msgstr "Retalla el patró."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:59
msgid "Brush"
msgstr "Pinzell"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:59
msgid "Cuts the brush-tip off."
msgstr "Retalla la punta del pinzell."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:61
msgid "Cutoff policy"
msgstr "Política de retall"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:64
msgid ""
"Cutoff is... the grayscale range that you can limit the texture to. This "
"also affects the limit takes by the strength. In the below example, we move "
"from the right arrow moved close to the left one, resulting in only the "
"darkest values being drawn. After that, three images with larger range, and "
"underneath that, three ranges with the left arrow moved, result in the "
"darkest values being cut away, leaving only the lightest. The last example "
"is the pattern without cutoff."
msgstr ""
"Retall és... l'interval de l'escala de grisos al que podreu limitar la "
"textura. Això també afectarà el límit que prendrà la intensitat. En el "
"següent exemple, ens movem des de la fletxa dreta moguda prop de l'esquerra, "
"el que resultarà en el fet que només es dibuixaran els valors més foscos. "
"Després d'això, tres imatges amb un interval major, i sota d'això, tres "
"intervals amb la fletxa esquerra moguda, donen com a resultat que es "
"retallen els valors més foscos, deixant només els més clars. L'últim exemple "
"és el patró sense retall."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:66
msgid "Cutoff"
msgstr "Retall"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:69
msgid "Invert the pattern."
msgstr "Inverteix el patró."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:71
msgid "Invert Pattern"
msgstr "Inversió del patró"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:73
msgid "Brightness and Contrast"
msgstr "Brillantor i contrast"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:77
msgid ""
"Adjust the pattern with a simple brightness/contrast filter to make it "
"easier to use. Because Subtract and Multiply work differently, it's "
"recommended to use different values with each:"
msgstr ""
"Ajusta el patró amb un filtre de brillantor/contrast senzill perquè sigui "
"més fàcil d'emprar. A causa que Sostreu i Multiplica funcionen de manera "
"diferent, es recomana emprar valors diferents per a cadascun:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:79
msgid ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_3_1_brushengine_texture_07.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_3_1_brushengine_texture_07.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:81
msgid "Neutral Point adjustment:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:85
msgid "Neutral Point"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:85
msgid ""
"Adjust the gray value that is considered neutral in the texture.  0.5 keeps "
"the texture as is; higher values make the texture darker, and lower values "
"make the texture lighter.  Works a bit differently from the brightness "
"option, and is mostly useful to adjust existing textures to work well with "
"Lightness Map and Gradient Map modes (though it can have applications with "
"the other two modes)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:88
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "Intensitat"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:90
msgid ""
"This allows you to set the texture to Sensors. It will use the cutoff to "
"continuously draw lighter values of the texture (making the result darker)."
msgstr ""
"Permetrà establir la textura als Sensors. Utilitzarà el retall per a "
"dibuixar contínuament els valors més clars de la textura (enfosquint el "
"resultat)."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/texture.rst:92
msgid ""
"For Lightness Map and Gradient Map modes, Strength controls how much of the "
"texture is applied compared to how much of the selected paint color comes "
"through."
msgstr ""

